+---
+name: figma-precise-restore
+description: 首次接收Figma链接时执行全元素直出还原流程。用于用户要求按UI稿精准实现、减少二次微调、非核心组件不抽象复用、页面与设计稿强一致的场景。默认执行设计拉取、资产本地化、防变形处理、全量元素落地、首轮对比修正与复验。
+---
+
+# Figma Precise Restore
+
+## 中文使用方法
+
+可直接触发：
+
+- “按 UI 稿全量还原”
+- “首次就做精准实现，不要后面再大量微调”
+- “Figma 链接已给，直接全元素落地”
+- “页面和设计稿强一致实现”
+
+建议同时提供：
+
+- Figma 链接（含 node-id）
+- 目标路由或页面名
+- 是否允许响应式调整（默认桌面稿优先）
+
+## Scope
+
+- **Core components** (design system / shared reusable components): reuse existing project components when appropriate.
+- **Non-core page elements** (page-specific sections, cards, keyboards, hint panels, stat strips, etc.): implement all visible elements directly from design; do not over-abstract.
+
+## Mandatory Workflow
+
+1. Parse and fetch design source
+
+   - Extract `fileKey` and `node-id`.
+   - Call Figma `get_design_context(fileKey, nodeId)` to obtain reference code and screenshot context.
+
+2. Localize assets
+
+   - Collect all returned asset URLs from `https://www.figma.com/api/mcp/asset/...`.
+   - Download assets to local project directories (default: `src/assets/images/`).
+   - Use module-prefixed semantic filenames and kebab-case (e.g. `nav-home.svg`, `card-keyboard.svg`).
+   - Keep runtime UI code free of remote Figma asset URLs.
+
+3. Normalize SVGs (required, anti-distortion)
+
+   - Keep `viewBox` intact.
+   - Replace `preserveAspectRatio="none"` with `preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet"`.
+   - If `preserveAspectRatio` is missing, add `preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet"` on root `<svg>`.
+   - Use `object-fit: contain` for constrained icon/image boxes.
+   - Use per-icon size classes for non-uniform icon ratios.
+
+4. First-pass implementation strategy (critical)
+
+- For all elements, implement full visible structure directly from the design (layout, size, spacing, typography, shadow, border).
+- Do not default to approximate values followed by heavy later tuning.
+- Do not collapse visible hierarchy or remove explicit visual elements from the design.
+- Do not abstract page-specific blocks into generic components.
+
+5. Precision mapping order
+
+   - Layout metrics: container dimensions, section gaps, paddings.
+   - Typography: font size, weight, line height, color hierarchy.
+   - Control visuals: radius, border, shadow, gradient/background.
+   - Icon/image visuals: ratio, occupied area, alignment.
+   - States: selected/active/hover when visible in the design.
+
+6. First-round auto comparison and correction (required)
+
+   - Immediately compare implementation against design after first pass.
+   - Prioritize and fix P0/P1 differences in the same round.
+   - Run at least one correction-and-recheck loop before concluding.
+
+7. Verification
+   - Keep existing project stack and conventions.
+   - Run `pnpm lint`.
+   - Run `pnpm lint:style` when style files changed.
+
+## Delivery Output
+
+Each delivery must include:
+
+- aligned scope (pages/sections)
+- fixes applied in this round (ordered by impact)
+- remaining minor deltas (if any)
+- verification results (`lint` / `lint:style`)
+
+## Constraints
+
+- Do not introduce Tailwind unless explicitly requested.
+- Do not add generated-code marker comments.
+- Do not modify unrelated files.
+- Do not claim full alignment if structural visual deltas still exist.
+
+## Quick Checklist
+
+- [ ] Figma node parsed correctly
+- [ ] Assets localized to project directory
+- [ ] SVGs normalized for anti-distortion
+- [ ] Non-core elements implemented directly
+- [ ] At least one compare-fix-recheck loop completed
+- [ ] `lint` / `lint:style` passed
