+---
+name: ui-compare-fix
+description: 对比实际页面截图与Figma设计稿并执行修正闭环。用于用户提到修正、页面对比、按UI稿还原、像素级对齐、修复、和设计稿不一致时，产出差异清单并完成样式/结构修复与复验。
+---
+
+# UI Compare Fix
+
+## 中文使用方法
+
+可直接用这些指令触发本 skill：
+
+- “修正”
+- ”按 UI 稿还原“
+- “页面对比”
+- “和设计稿不一致”
+- “像素级对齐”
+- “修复”
+
+建议同时提供：
+
+- 当前页面截图
+- Figma 链接（可选）
+
+## Purpose
+
+Use this skill to run a full visual alignment loop:
+
+1. collect references
+2. compare and prioritize gaps
+3. implement fixes
+4. verify again
+
+Goal: make implemented UI match Figma intent with minimal, controlled edits.
+
+## Trigger Conditions
+
+Apply when user asks any of:
+
+- 修正
+- 页面对比
+- 按UI稿还原
+- 像素级对齐
+- 和设计稿不一致
+- 修复
+
+Typical inputs:
+
+- Figma URL (`figma.com/design/...`)
+- actual screenshot(s)
+- target route/component
+
+## Required Workflow
+
+1. Confirm scope
+
+   - Identify target page route/component.
+   - Identify design source (Figma fileKey + node-id).
+   - Identify actual screenshot source (user image or runtime capture).
+
+2. Pull design reference
+
+   - Call Figma `get_design_context(fileKey, nodeId)`.
+   - If assets are needed, localize them before implementation.
+   - Do not ship runtime UI with remote Figma asset URLs.
+
+3. Run structured visual comparison
+
+   - Layout: overall width, spacing, alignment, section positions.
+   - Typography: font size, weight, line-height, color hierarchy.
+   - Components: radius, border, shadow, control sizes.
+   - Icons/images: aspect ratio, container fit, visual weight.
+   - States: hover/active/selected styles if visible in稿.
+
+4. Output a prioritized gap list
+
+   - P0: obvious structural mismatch.
+   - P1: strong visual mismatch.
+   - P2: micro-tuning items.
+   - Keep each item actionable and tied to concrete selectors/files.
+
+5. Implement fixes incrementally
+
+   - Prefer small SCSS/TSX edits over large rewrites.
+   - Keep project stack/conventions unchanged.
+   - Reuse existing components and tokens when possible.
+   - Avoid introducing Tailwind unless explicitly requested.
+
+6. Anti-distortion rules (required)
+
+   - Preserve SVG `viewBox`.
+   - If `preserveAspectRatio="none"` exists, replace with `xMidYMid meet`.
+   - Prefer one fixed dimension + the other auto for icons.
+   - Use `object-fit: contain` in constrained icon boxes.
+   - Use per-icon size classes for non-uniform icon ratios.
+
+7. Validate after edits
+   - Run `pnpm lint`.
+   - Run `pnpm lint:style` when style files changed.
+   - Re-check key visual deltas; continue until main gaps close.
+
+## Output Format
+
+When reporting back, use:
+
+- Compared scope
+- Fixed items (ordered by impact)
+- Remaining minor deltas (if any)
+- Verification results (`lint`, `lint:style`)
+
+## Implementation Rules
+
+- Keep edits minimal and reversible.
+- Do not modify unrelated files.
+- Do not add generated-code marker comments.
+- Do not claim pixel-perfect if residual gaps remain.
+
+## Quick Checklist
+
+- [ ] Figma node parsed correctly
+- [ ] Actual screenshot compared against UI稿
+- [ ] Gap list produced with priority
+- [ ] Fixes landed in code
+- [ ] SVG ratio rules satisfied
+- [ ] Lint/stylelint passed
+- [ ] Final report includes remaining risks
