-### One-shot child intents
+### 一次性子组件意图
 
-When the parent must nudge a child that owns its own UI state (e.g. tabs), pass **intent + monotonically increasing `key`** instead of lifting all child state. The child tracks the last consumed key, runs the action once per new key, then calls `onConsumed(key)`. The parent clears intent only when `intent.key === consumedKey`, so a slow effect cannot wipe a newer click.
+当父组件必须触发一个拥有自身 UI 状态（例如 tabs）的子组件时，传递 **intent + 单调递增的 `key`**，而不是提升所有子组件状态。子组件记录最后消费的 key，对每个新 key 执行一次动作，然后调用 `onConsumed(key)`。父组件仅在 `intent.key === consumedKey` 时清空 intent，因此较慢的 effect 不会清掉更新的点击。
 
-Use when the child owns normal interactions and the parent only fires occasional switches; same intent repeated must bump `key`. Avoid `defaultActiveKey` for repeatable actions (mount-only); avoid full parent control unless the parent truly owns the flow.
+适用于子组件拥有常规交互、父组件只偶尔触发切换的场景；重复相同 intent 时必须递增 `key`。避免将 `defaultActiveKey` 用于可重复动作（它只在挂载时生效）；除非父组件真正拥有该流程，否则避免完全由父组件控制。
 
